{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2022-09-16 06:50:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. ACQUIRES STORAGE EXPRESS AND APPOINTS JEFFERSON SHREVE TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'ACQUISITION ADDS 107 REMOTELY OPERATED STORES TO THE EXTRA SPACE STORAGE PLATFORM SALT LAKE CITY , SEPT. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES (COLLECTIVELY "EXTRA SPACE" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: EXR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF MULTIPLE ENTITIES DOING BUSINESS AS STORAGE EXPRESS ("STORAGE EXPRESS"), WHICH OWN 107 REMOTE STORAGE PROPERTIES ACROSS INDIANA, OHIO, ILLINOIS AND KENTUCKY.'}